Help window, showing key gameplay mechanics in action so you can learn how to play faster.Thank you to everyone sharing feedback and suggestions! You're helping make Metromino better with every update.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T18:59:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685342","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5316210-1846018067942369","game_id":"steam-5316210","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Achievements Are Here!","summary":"Build a massive metropolis, become a billionaire, fill an entire map with 9,801 cells, or try some unusual strategies along the way. All achievements are now integrated with Steam and will be available in the full version of Metromino. And there's more coming! By the way, if you've already played the demo, I'd love to hear your feedback! Your thoughts will help me improve the game and make Metromino even better.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T22:12:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942369","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5316210-1846018067932644","game_id":"steam-5316210","kind":"announcement","title":"Let Me See Those Tiny Houses!","summary":"Let Me See Those Tiny Houses!The first feedback from Metromino players made one thing very clear: you want to see those tiny houses up close!So I made it possible.You can now zoom the camera in much closer and get a better look at your city - the houses, streets, and all those little details that were previously just a bit too tiny.It may be a small update, but it came directly from your feedback.Thank you to everyone who has played the demo and shared their thoughts. You're already helping me m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T09:05:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932644","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5316210-1845383656388177","game_id":"steam-5316210","kind":"announcement","title":"Before you start building your first city","summary":"The Metromino demo is coming soon!Before you start building your first city, here are a few useful tips to help you understand the main mechanics of the game. In this video, you'll learn how to: • Grow your city population • Place roads efficiently • Upgrade roads with tetromino pieces • Improve buildings with city services • Manage your city budget • Generate income • Avoid spending too much on unnecessary upgrades Metromino is a casual city-building strategy game where you expand your city by ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T01:26:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388177","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5316210-1844751498231271","game_id":"steam-5316210","kind":"announcement","title":"Metromino Announcement Trailer","summary":"I'm excited to share the first official trailer for Metromino!Metromino is a casual city-building game where you build your city using tetromino pieces.Plan your roads, make the most of limited space, grow new neighborhoods, upgrade your infrastructure, and turn a small settlement into a thriving city.🎬 Watch the trailer below! The Metromino demo is coming soon, so if the game looks interesting, consider adding it to your Steam Wishlist.And let me know what you think about the trailer and the ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T11:50:51Z","